<title>UK: Credit Local sets 1.0 bln FFR fungible 2009 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 1.0 bln FFR fungible 2009 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Credit Agricole Indosuez.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    26.FEB.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.24    PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    102.29    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     GOV LAW     FRENCH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10/45 BP  SELL CONC  75 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH 2.0 BLN FFR BOND LAUNCHED ON 05.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
